  "body": "Some homes have a special feeling the moment you arrive. Tucked away at the top of a peaceful cul-de-sac, this beautifully enhanced freehold home offers the perfect balance of comfortable family living, modern updates and outdoor enjoyment.\r\n\r\nStep inside and enjoy the refreshed interiors, with an updated kitchen and bathrooms adding a fresh, modern feel.  Predominantly single-level living, there is plenty of room for the whole family to spread out and enjoy.\r\n\r\nBut it's outside where this home really comes into its own! The backyard has been beautifully transformed, with a recently created covered entertaining area that extends the living space and makes outdoor living a pleasure whatever the weather. Surrounded by a garden bursting with colour, fruit and seasonal blooms, there's a lovely sense of warmth and charm, while a grapevine, with fruit and just beginning to ripen, frames the entertaining area beautifully. \r\n\r\nThink relaxed weekend barbecues, long summer evenings, family celebrations or simply enjoying a quiet coffee surrounded by nature. It's a space that brings people together and makes the most of home life.\r\n\r\nThis established garden offers privacy, space and plenty of charm, safe and secure for kids and 4 legged friends there is also a vegetable patch, adding to its appeal.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n- 699m2 (more or less) freehold section\r\n- Approximately 180m2 floor area\r\n- 4 generous bedrooms and 2 bathrooms\r\n- Beautiful backyard with covered outdoor entertain\r\n- Solar water heating\r\n- Double garage with multiple off-street parking\r\n- Peaceful cul-de-sac position\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of being close to Torbay and Browns Bay villages, beautiful beaches, local shops and transport links. The property is safe walking distance to Glamorgan School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay college are also within easy reach. \r\n\r\nThe owners are ready for their next chapter and are motivated to see a result. Move in and enjoy this beautifully updated family home in a sought-after Torbay location. Don't let this opportunity pass you by!",
